ourcing_catalogue_unavailable","sales_funnel_campaign_not_found"]},"consumedUnavailableDetail":{"type":"string","nullable":true}},"required":["amountCents","period","dailyBudgetCents","periodStart","periodEnd","consumedCents","remainingCents","reached","refusedSpend","consumedUnavailableReason","consumedUnavailableDetail"],"description":"consumedCents = committed NET spend (actual + provisioned, what the org pays) of every campaign on the funnel's pipes for this brand x offer PLUS every lead SOURCE campaign (Start -> Lead found) feeding those pipes (sources[]): ALL-INCLUSIVE, sourcing + sending + LLM. Runs started in [periodStart, periodEnd). reached = consumedCents >= amountCents. null + a reason when it cannot be measured, never 0."},"maxVolume":{"type":"object","nullable":true,"properties":{"count":{"type":"integer"},"period":{"type":"string","enum":["one_off","daily","weekly","monthly"],"description":"UTC. daily = the calendar day; weekly = Monday 00:00 to the next Monday; monthly = the calendar month; one_off = once, counted from when the cap was first stated in this period (never resets)."},"unit":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["first_contacts","prospects_handled"],"description":"What a max volume counts. first_contacts: the funnel has a proactive pipe (each first contact it makes). prospects_handled: every pipe is reactive (each prospect a reactive pipe takes on once they reached its start step)."},"periodStart":{"type":"string"},"periodEnd":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"consumed":{"type":"integer","nullable":true},"remaining":{"type":"integer","nullable":true},"reached":{"type":"boolean","nullable":true},"consumedUnavailableReason":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["sales_funnel_not_found","sales_funnel_catalogue_unavailable","campaign_service_unconfigured","campaign_service_unavailable","runs_service_unavailable","no_proactive_pipe","volume_not_measured_on_channel","sourcing_catalogue_unavailable","sales_funnel_campaign_not_found"]},"consumedUnavailableDetail":{"type":"string","nullable":true}},"required":["count","period","unit","periodStart","periodEnd","consumed","remaining","reached","consumedUnavailableReason","consumedUnavailableDetail"],"description":"unit first_contacts: consumed = first contacts the funnel's PROACTIVE pipes made in the window (cold email: the first email of each prospect's sequence, completed or in flight). unit prospects_handled (all pipes reactive): consumed = prospects the FIRST reactive pipe took on (AI meeting booking: workflow runs that called the LLM; AI Follow-up Email: each email sent to one person). Any channel whose leg PRODUCES a step with a declared run (email_sent: one email sent), or whose reactive funnel fires on a trigger with a declared run (email_pushed_via_api: one email sent, Email Sending), is measured by that run, no per-channel entry. A channel with no measure yet answers null + volume_not_measured_on_channel. unit null = the funnel is unreadable."},"salesFunnelName":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"salesFunnelType":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["proactive","reactive"],"description":"features-service's served funnel type, RELAYED (never derived here): proactive when at least one pipe is proactive, else reactive. Labels the caps: proactive = Max budget / Max volume, reactive = Up to $X / Up to N."},"salesFunnelTypeUnavailableReason":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["type_not_served_by_features_service","sales_funnel_not_found","sales_funnel_catalogue_unavailable"]},"volumeUnit":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["first_contacts","prospects_handled"],"description":"What a max volume counts. first_contacts: the funnel has a proactive pipe (each first contact it makes). prospects_handled: every pipe is reactive (each prospect a reactive pipe takes on once they reached its start step)."},"pipes":{"type":"array",","note":"Narrow the request (a filter, a limit, one id) to read the rest."}}],"needsTheirYes":{"why":"Changes the s